{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S06、S13等段落的叙事句切得较碎、提示较密，连续读完整段心理变化时不如X的整句叙述流畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句和【】重点让人扫屏时更容易抓住每段的心理转折，感受字较小且按音乐节点出现，也避免了一次面对整堆短词的负担。它把怀念、委屈、孤独、想回去又不愿再受委屈，直到带着想念继续生活的过程交代得更细，人物为什么这样想也更容易理解；音乐感受则有更多具体的声音、动作和身体反应，前后呼应也更充分。X的整句叙述确实更顺畅，但右侧感受容易成为并列的情绪标签，部分细节缺少与人物心理变化的对应。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "20c28d5b-e736-42e6-a212-3763d26b7980", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T195352343583Z", "elapsed_seconds": 102.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:55:35.166582+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b37e47359382d0af9afa94520d93269e8a0062c9e213d7d837de1bbb394ac00a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w